<font class="content">Posted On 2002-03-03 18:25:09 by <a href="http://">Charoth</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><IMG SRC="tempimages/telkorenar.jpg"><br /><br />We're coming for you!<br /><br />However, thanks to our good friends at Project Eon/Anavon, Telk was slain the next day :) Next time I guess, but now we do have a nice armor farming spot for the next 3 days or so, and good West Wing spots are nice.<BR><BR>Oh, I just had to put something in the "extended text" area because the rest do, not much to say for the raid, we farmed some armor for a few hours, lots of people logged on so we CoH'd to Telk, did our little clear, got him to 50% on the first try, changed up the strategy a bit, and got him to that screenshot the next time. But since it was 3 am, most of the east coasters were dropping dead, so we called it a night.<br /><br />Great fight, one of our longer ones and I was quite impressed by how well we kept our tanks alive for that long, just a few dps short of killing him. He has alot of HP now, since his buff, and we're just behind the needed dps for us to kill him in under 9 minutes or so. Next time, the big dragon goes down!</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br>


